GROWTH GAPS

1. Episodic Challenge Series vs. Standalone AI Tips
Top competitor @dhavalkataria_ achieves a 20.57% engagement rate by structuring content around episodic challenge series (e.g., "Episode 1 of UN-BROKE-ING INDIA: Can I make 50,000 using..."). In contrast, @garvit.irl currently publishes isolated tool comparisons and voice cloning tutorials without an ongoing storytelling narrative or clear proof of results.

